WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:04.600
Something's happening.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:08.960
We can't stay here.

00:00:12.095 --> 00:00:13.095
Dad.

00:00:26.975 --> 00:00:29.445
(Cough)

00:00:33.945 --> 00:00:34.945
They're back.

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:41.500
Cities across the Eastern Seaboard are coming under attack.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.920
The CDC is warning to stay in your homes

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:47.080
and avoid contact with these creatures at all cost.

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:52.520
I'm sure this is all going to be over soon. I promise.

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:55.960
Entire regions of the country are being wiped off the map.

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:00.880
It's like we're back in the Dark Ages.

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:04.640
People are surviving.

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:09.940
We can't trust anyone now.

00:01:16.780 --> 00:01:18.240
No noise.

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:20.980
Listen... Listen...

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:23.160
Listen...

00:01:24.440 --> 00:01:25.780
Listen... Listen...

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:28.760
Listen... Listen...

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:32.700
Listen... Listen... Listen...

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:37.980
Listen... Listen... Listen...

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:40.660
Listen... Listen... Listen...

